# An index outside the fields of a Structure is an execution error (the book, structure-index): the index counts the
# immediate fields from zero.
# Plan M11 5v: the declarations of ordinary Structures live in the data part of main; the root holds places and the call main().
sub: main () (
    S:
        int: a 1
        int: b 2
    int: t 0
)
    t := typeof(S[2])
main()
int: t main\data\t
